<title>UK: UK Treasury says budget tightens policy by 1/2 pct.</title>
<headline>UK Treasury says budget tightens policy by 1/2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Treasury said measures announced in the budget, excluding the windfall tax and associated spending, tighten fiscal policy by around 1/2 percent of GDP in 1998/99.  </p>
<p>&quot;The measures announced in the budget, exluding windfall tax associated spending, tighten policy by around 1/2 percent of GDP in 1998-99,&quot; it said in its 'red book'.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
